 "sentences": [
  "This royal yacht was built in 1938.",
  "She was meant to serve as a patrol boat in wartime.",
  "Instead, senior admirals used her as an admiralty yacht.",
  "Italians captured her in April 1941 during the Axis invasion.",
  "The Italian Navy used her as a gunboat for coastal escort duties.",
  "She finally returned to the Yugoslav Royal Navy-in-exile in 1943."
